<title>INDIA: Power failure plunges India's Bombay into darkness.</title>
<headline>Power failure plunges India's Bombay into darkness.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A major power failure plunged India's commercial capital Bombay into darkness late on Friday, police officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;Bombay, Thane and two other adjoining districts of Maharashtra are totally in the dark,&quot; an official at the state police headquarters told Reuters.</p>
